  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are quick to see and seize the most valuable shiny objects.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Scavenger’s Eye<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain a bonus on Appraise checks equal to one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1). You may determine the most valuable item in a hoard as a move action and gain a bonus equal to your mythic tier on Appraise checks to do so. You can spend one use of mythic power to reroll any failed Appraise check. You must take the results of the second roll, even if worse; however any roll on your Appraise check that is less than your mythic tier is treated as if it were equal to your mythic tier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc37\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
